  "releaseNotes": "Dependency maintenance release updating ONNX Runtime, NAudio, Microsoft.Extensions, OpenTelemetry, SourceLink, test tooling, and ASP.NET 8 packages while retaining .NET 8, .NET 10, and .NET 11 assets. NAudio 2.4 playback buffer initialization and Windows platform annotations are updated without changing audio behavior. Microsoft.Extensions.AI remains 10.11.0 for compatibility across all target frameworks. No speech pipeline defaults change. All twelve packages are released together.",
